@startuml module_structure_diagram

title File Organization - Module Structure

skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "src/" {

    ' ========================================
    ' ENTRY POINT
    ' ========================================
    file "__main__.py" as MAIN_FILE

    ' ========================================
    ' CLI LAYER
    ' ========================================
    package "cli/" {
        file "__init__.py" as CLI_INIT
        file "workflow_cli.py" as CLI_MAIN
        file "interactive_menu.py" as CLI_MENU
    }

    ' ========================================
    ' SERVICE LAYER
    ' ========================================
    package "services/" {
        file "__init__.py" as SVC_INIT
        file "workflow_run_service.py" as SVC_RUN
        file "workflow_run_attempt_service.py" as SVC_ATTEMPT
        file "workflow_run_tracker.py" as SVC_TRACKER
        file "statistics_service.py" as SVC_STATS
        file "workflow_export_import_service.py" as SVC_EXPORT
    }

    ' ========================================
    ' ADAPTERS LAYER - GitHub Integration
    ' ========================================
    package "adapters/" {
        file "__init__.py" as ADAPT_ROOT_INIT

        package "github/" {
            file "__init__.py" as GITHUB_INIT
            file "base.py" as GITHUB_BASE
            file "api_fetcher.py" as GITHUB_API
            file "cli_fetcher.py" as GITHUB_CLI
            file "factory.py" as GITHUB_FACTORY
            file "auth.py" as GITHUB_AUTH
            file "exceptions.py" as GITHUB_EXC
        }
    }

    ' ========================================
    ' STORAGE LAYER
    ' ========================================
    package "storage/" {
        file "__init__.py" as STOR_INIT
        file "base.py" as STOR_BASE
        file "workflow_json_storage.py" as STOR_IMPL
    }

    ' ========================================
    ' MODELS LAYER
    ' ========================================
    package "models/" {
        file "__init__.py" as MODEL_INIT
        file "workflow_run.py" as MODEL_RUN
        file "workflow_run_attempt.py" as MODEL_ATTEMPT
        file "workflow_status.py" as MODEL_STATUS
        file "workflow_conclusion.py" as MODEL_CONCLUSION
        file "statistics_report.py" as MODEL_REPORT
        file "import_result.py" as MODEL_IMPORT
        file "github_workflow_run_factory.py" as MODEL_FACTORY
    }

    ' ========================================
    ' LEGACY AUTH LOCATION (kept for ref)
    ' ========================================
    package "auth/" {
        file "__init__.py" as AUTH_INIT
        file "github_auth.py" as AUTH_LEGACY
    }

    ' ========================================
    ' LEGACY EXCEPTIONS (kept for ref)
    ' ========================================
    package "exceptions/" {
        file "__init__.py" as EXC_INIT
        file "github_exceptions.py" as EXC_LEGACY
    }

    ' ========================================
    ' LEGACY SERVICES (kept for ref)
    ' ========================================
    package "services/" {
        file "github_api_fetcher.py" as SVC_API_LEGACY
        file "github_cli_fetcher.py" as SVC_CLI_LEGACY
    }
}

MAIN_FILE --> CLI_MAIN
MAIN_FILE --> CLI_MENU

CLI_MAIN --> SVC_RUN
CLI_MAIN --> GITHUB_API
CLI_MENU --> SVC_RUN
CLI_MENU --> GITHUB_API

SVC_RUN --> STOR_BASE
SVC_ATTEMPT --> STOR_BASE
SVC_RUN --> MODEL_RUN
SVC_ATTEMPT --> MODEL_ATTEMPT

GITHUB_API --> GITHUB_FACTORY
GITHUB_API --> GITHUB_AUTH
GITHUB_API --> GITHUB_EXC

STOR_IMPL --> STOR_BASE
STOR_IMPL --> MODEL_RUN
STOR_IMPL --> MODEL_ATTEMPT

GITHUB_FACTORY --> MODEL_RUN
GITHUB_FACTORY --> MODEL_STATUS
GITHUB_FACTORY --> MODEL_CONCLUSION

note right of STOR_BASE
  **Layer Separation Achieved**

  Layer 4: Storage abstraction
  via protocols (base.py)

  Layer 5: Storage implementation
  (workflow_json_storage.py)
end note

note bottom of GITHUB_API
  **Consolidation Complete**

  All GitHub integration moved
  to adapters/github/ module:
  - api_fetcher.py
  - cli_fetcher.py
  - factory.py
  - auth.py
  - exceptions.py
  - base.py (protocol)
end note

@enduml
